 Backport-Note:
 Minimal backport for PCP 6.3.8. pmlogmv.c differs structurally from the 7.x tree;
  rather than the full open/read/write copy + __pmProcessPipe rewrite, this closes the
  injection by validating the source name (oldname) as well as the destination and by
  hardening the check_name() blocklist (adds backtick, braces, backslash). This report
  item carries no CVE - pmlogmv runs as the invoking user, crossing no privilege boundary.


